{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b9bb1341f647bc21e9e56db2ea02691e26b3cb4109732a4645eefb53a03a7b76",
      "source_sha256": "2678d382c74a56dd42f80445edb6f2048c90bb7313110bbda556f5a801cb8504",
      "translation": "看到交战双方的首领站在一起，想必各位都很吃惊吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0972e7c6f4228c644438055f3d9ef27b571b3668cdeada23f0a15fe071a93889",
      "source_sha256": "b3f55baa6ac3cb063694166ae1cdc869c4addfc0b7d5f7505493c9dc26936589",
      "translation": "我，修恩扎伊特，在此宣布：我与南部军总司令亚历克斯伯爵，已为结束这场内战缔结停战协议。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cc6cd087b5bb3ec5ed83712f772cd37b03d74840c08d4a68a49dc031cfed7c22",
      "source_sha256": "2d608b18f25d3c8f5d6318733e6708609f0f816e95e9723f5610d535df3f3d77",
      "translation": "什么……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:db0c668122bcbbae510d96cfbda4625bb59929de38230af2b102da3e3643aee4",
      "source_sha256": "66deef2b9dc08010a2457b251338b9522ffc8750f0644e06409e7579ce4196b0",
      "translation": "啊，真、真的……战争要结束了吗！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:994150ae9c8388978db45f37c21db20070ac19c586559543b868cca3e9667565",
      "source_sha256": "ef6b04a7ee7eb3e4a6aeccbed6682830471cd526a8ea05966807b09cf991aa8c",
      "translation": "自卡尔塔大战以来，在拉·斯特拉达的守护下，我们在富足的环境中度过了千余年。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:37d4a57507adcc4b6483b0e9380d1a2d94d7039f1de22604d65d9b4abb4a1951",
      "source_sha256": "5066a929572fba420f4d84334f5266ae0f95891b9f8280c6cb16749a473f267d",
      "translation": "然而，如今灾祸种再次降临。我们的乐园正面临消失的危机。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:27df471debf3db0c179b792e4d1c818e12c703c9d6ac45baac76a4d3f2ebcb54",
      "source_sha256": "277fe0be08e2bf9afda0e4455fb6873d4abf6e637bd0bba415c8dc6b1da53bd4",
      "translation": "灾祸种若继续下去，用不了多久，我们就将面临灭亡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be071766bc0a89be26fc220dc6fd6a1bfd828d85ab0250bcdad44d66b2c8e93a",
      "source_sha256": "db2e26c5c28052d382be5dad812e855985e93f62af37384ea68f930191cf0aac",
      "translation": "可是，我们知道阻止灾祸种的方法。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a1a817487c04c10e1146942f7a2f0a54def19549cda77355e324ffad5f24d5ee",
      "source_sha256": "5d53ae437c98b9c7d7e1ba7e9c92a8d144e1d369aff7e4ceea7226c6af6e4f18",
      "translation": "那就是玛格纳卡尔塔。唯有玛格纳卡尔塔的奇迹，才能拯救我们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:20654d5d0474da5131c903ed54c4cb75f9942f38f39b53b12fce9d443869d713",
      "source_sha256": "7586c369fed9cc368edb4f9161af4d108ce77d998d5873cad847d5e1cc171ad2",
      "translation": "那么，如今玛格纳卡尔塔在哪里？为找到此人，我不辞辛劳，终于找到了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:140d1cc8443a583d442063c1f8102ef8ce3d0d0912b5a47765b27cfcd6b1fef4",
      "source_sha256": "371aae6f10a349242adb68a0ec9bcb80e25cc7fca550da3d608fe52851ce8af0",
      "translation": "正是蕾洁菲尔妲公主。眼前这位，就是独一无二的玛格纳卡尔塔。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:87d42b860dc1e92658fea4f27c0adcc3c9a2594e4287dbbcca1980eb70696ff8",
      "source_sha256": "93264a4eea8f818636af355b64baa713a8bb38815f7b2e356e18367adcc8a2f9",
      "translation": "那混蛋……到底在胡说些什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b502da75a06008347aad0e3780db9e6e561659c42e09cb5fecc11b9d349d016e",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:952f3ab9d7b7fe6a898c85c13a6a4dee70b732e95f8b0bb1a06b286b5b477fe2",
      "source_sha256": "a33c269d7fc304f18b8a4c1966a851733390589880db915679b3a89e48ea9078",
      "translation": "一国公主为何会是这副模样，想必有人心怀疑问，也有人愤愤不平。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9aaae7174711d6b300a638754dbd12a14901bae81caadd0a08ed860fbb8f781e",
      "source_sha256": "b8eeae81d781756f853ba9811f3b1024ea972669f179facadb51a6290804197b",
      "translation": "今天，我终于要在这里，向各位揭露一直隐瞒至今的真相。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ef89ea5361a76d1c728cf2dc31bda79b899700ad4769b48558dd8bfd2c34ae54",
      "source_sha256": "c127748d8342337fc1773e2cd19a69b988f64383a596523013b0b4ef5cac275b",
      "translation": "尊敬公主的人或许会失望，但公主一直在彻头彻尾地欺骗各位。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:84ffeb2ba64080607ab2a4750f7caa1947b2639440348f274b418d45a3471c34",
      "source_sha256": "90b8f6d35cd43688dca4203a89fbd29af3026256fadc6a05058c33b4c5bcabb5",
      "translation": "什么意思……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cc4e9e3081ccfd1c308fcecf4e727a84dbe949fcd18bc6dd779f2145c4343f3e",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07f63cff18fbd94d1f1ace04bdf6f5cd39d6a609dccffab615eb613d7909700c",
      "source_sha256": "85cda04eea990a314b51305e96db34bf576c627791194555514ad37b68e3ed74",
      "translation": "所谓玛格纳卡尔塔，原本指的是拥有庞大KAN之人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5f5739bc418a9344f64a89ac239291c63af36586ccfca04ffa4a6138830c117b",
      "source_sha256": "e9ff33231c35b6752b901f5edfa0d02d8cc4ba93cc3506aba833452a706b54eb",
      "translation": "唯有玛格纳卡尔塔，才能为这个因灾祸种而日渐干涸的世界，带来甘霖般的救赎。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:11eeb69d8a42fb1967f379064054376d5a0cb9328a23d4f21c78581818645c6a",
      "source_sha256": "65dab9fbe32af93dad753c03e977a5eb20de0622e5d84cc7e3c4b42441aef9fa",
      "translation": "各位或许以为那只是传说，但玛格纳卡尔塔曾让灾祸种停止，这全都是历史事实。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:08b79c65a54f89c520102c973a5f1e08abc74811025eea777e312b3cdb5e5a74",
      "source_sha256": "26d2ebbcb9afd6a32aeaecd79b5c80af4fd2b938ffee561c1a32c06f4411e286",
      "translation": "正是因为玛格纳卡尔塔崇高的牺牲，我们才能安宁地生活千余年。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4ef763b994ecde288e15be9e5de8d169462e0f19127b50d45bccda483daf228c",
      "source_sha256": "ed853e8d2ba339ec911b7d19f4558fb86ad55124070eae2fb9f4714699d9ed38",
      "translation": "而如今，只要玛格纳卡尔塔做出牺牲，灾祸种就会停止，兰兹海姆也将恢复往昔的模样。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:14f4a28c209305ad774a661be3a5514db2bd99f5386c5a88bf237a1b6449e05a",
      "source_sha256": "2d203e7d45262425f0b50b36306f9df1359fa751a6bfefe4dba13cf4c5941b28",
      "translation": "牺牲……难道……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e2b1272383889cea815e4786e8ed35da30e1ed7a55090ec6613605086e0975e3",
      "source_sha256": "cbe09a11ba637e4f1900d6044c1dc6705ba64a8902838a10b2c7f812a2315b4b",
      "translation": "我将这一切真相禀告了先王陛下。可是，陛下拒绝牺牲自己的女儿，反而将我诬为叛徒，企图处决我。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a04f336bbf9e224d39083fb03bb46ceb0d315a70949f455285e0e422148905a1",
      "source_sha256": "7a11bb2ae1616cb900cf37000908abee929424e39a8b5d9b44c4b0e3af1eafb0",
      "translation": "所以，我必须做出决断。究竟是为了兰兹海姆而战，还是就这样任由兰兹海姆灭亡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f733dd9ec3903077802d9f9246d6cc1c39881a1a2f9a4577303bb71c9bd61137",
      "source_sha256": "117acdb266146c2117b7c58fd406f28f91cc7f102b4d63756b3f3e531b1f2a22",
      "translation": "最终，我决心让自己化身恶魔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cf751969f023c9cea1b326e2614339915758a3228d987c83b9f88ceedfb4c8a2",
      "source_sha256": "bca54bd0b1c17b3c185da5bff68393612ba65dce13e6d1a2c84ecc7a4dc5107d",
      "translation": "为了兰兹海姆，我愿赌上自己的性命。正因如此，我才发动了叛乱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:23de2576e4ef962c60a8035df32cb60913e40da7be1504d2865d408c6b609352",
      "source_sha256": "0cdc66341182327abbaddbccbf68e18e15d4b4f3a3423df6ad2bc3a57766c23d",
      "translation": "与如今饱受灾祸种之苦的国民相比，让自己的双手沾染鲜血，根本算不了什么。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:367e6e594960f48d6fdb7f7991c96e139debd485195814d0542cabd321d9a2dc",
      "source_sha256": "bccdf5e16c24a4430fa20b7cf6180d221ea1f25b3c941ce43e929018d490cae4",
      "translation": "当然，后来我也向公主坦白了真相。我恳求她，为了兰兹海姆，为了百姓，成为拯救世界的英雄。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3c83cc3421a56db8eb8341beb74841e2470a72a3dcfa167681b4c5b26e15c4b6",
      "source_sha256": "2c891348d331ecfe7a0dd7bd1b5fab7128d809fdf653f01b148cb88d484e104e",
      "translation": "可是，公主冷酷地拒绝了我的恳求。不仅如此，她还隐瞒真相，组建南部军，发动了战争。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:790c67b7d8520567e6bbebb238e1012d5dd90a97f38d3382fdd8ea1f538bdf9a",
      "source_sha256": "737f87180ee8ea4c84c9eb1c6b80fb5331e31fc98463d609077c5f9bb934e682",
      "translation": "她做出了只顾自己活命的自私选择。我只能默默应战。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7ed6c71f3cf4d1be9960709c6d1ae91e9e05ea164486eb44f9d01a8a21c0d27e",
      "source_sha256": "db0145f7420f0e745b9a6bf99cb3345e52d2b15f6f19366a52f7d7b595a25b82",
      "translation": "每个人都珍惜自己的性命。然而，公主身为下一任女王，肩负着守护兰兹海姆的使命。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b9edd95b5f2029187bacdaaa324c13d0474533b8008aaac36248885eac2ec3d1",
      "source_sha256": "eecadb408d3dcb6b8790f7190dc42fd56b3a2bf263b547dd3e7d54107e3b4295",
      "translation": "各位是不是期待着，像过去一样，只要战争结束，灾祸种也会停止？这一次，还是别做那种梦了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:af9e6f0915dde06835816c427f8b0fb53cba508a12e30eec7675667724234304",
      "source_sha256": "c3ad4cda3a55b3909ffe5eea289b03aeed24526200b448aea5b88195127418b3",
      "translation": "公主若不牺牲，这个世界就没有希望。我们将就此踏上无法回头的灭亡之路。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:868ddc6acc78da35101669b5663c1234cf694d34c3e8de15ebac7935c2f09953",
      "source_sha256": "380db9751545c1bdd64ecb666fef649a352c7fc18265beb3306c1222a9bfc8cf",
      "translation": "为一个人的生命，舍弃全人类的未来，这真的是正确的选择吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:39bc6d13c86e1d518af81e13c59ca56b915c1572b374cbfc3c6035b7f9bad357",
      "source_sha256": "3d154cd2f5448ce3ad5177973be106cc3b2f115359ae18cdd28d7957f2680177",
      "translation": "这个世界，是靠历代玛格纳卡尔塔的牺牲才得以获救的。事到如今，绝不能让一切化为乌有！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9c60b9d9d87ddca2a185851c8b9319bc4d17ff67b7ca30492c5ecccfbbcc2cbc",
      "source_sha256": "11bae429b9ba122faa7729f8450ce56228d913c06bbfcf694db973bbfbb7faa9",
      "translation": "如今，公主存在于这个世上，本身就是罪恶！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1a0af66ca957a95774e398d6c967e4b9a6208b1796baf09687b73c37e6e3615b",
      "source_sha256": "9ad2c706c11c1757c56b28d2bedba75a3280dcbc5f426604a614b4239cf60b0e",
      "translation": "怎么会……太过分了……公主怎么能这样！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ade4356b88351938162f852c90c558fa8eca5a3aecb7823e93fd9ccb756d1a71",
      "source_sha256": "76ecce881f43d72289fc4cf14ba55ff82b820dce22abb8a4de796c291015ded1",
      "translation": "将来要当女王的人，怎么能抛弃百姓？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2c243b99756e3e8e4bc808fb3b3db86e06f72f54df46e12a2c10395460135398",
      "source_sha256": "ef6dd65c830325647b0414b958244be3a8af79f9d9836e408a3f68138ab216a2",
      "translation": "兰兹海姆要是灭亡了，王位什么的，还有什么用！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bcd97870555210c88449d4c6f69122d21d106efbddd1221afff90a3752d7ecda",
      "source_sha256": "5218db9001c1f1c423db2684e97eb5e71dad48572253445209b3da6ebf0c7d9e",
      "translation": "清醒点。别被那种鬼话骗了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:130bc838eb98f13bcbdacd2619adbd5babd67fffb4279cc6f84a8d1d86b11f47",
      "source_sha256": "4c9e09161a43f87f0cd2a300ef7a5ce118b905e2f92f4fd776aff0e679050a8e",
      "translation": "那你拿出证据，证明这是鬼话啊。亚历克斯大人也站在那里。这就是真相！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:462cd1dcde75e5dc82ccbdd99344e76af35ea9b5c442f983b6ed2500dbc7fbf3",
      "source_sha256": "48e65f430118d09f9b6a72b9438bfbbea1839d4323709cb5f70e63dc1f635f1a",
      "translation": "公主是英雄斯特拉斯的后裔，却没有资格拥有玛格纳卡尔塔这个光荣的称号。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eef4119bd63d8a3fe27e158ae0c3b07ebfc28adeecebff84da19a29de16bab9a",
      "source_sha256": "14984cc44d9e0e89495ff3d957a6a3d96cf75c5a6f074a341da73272ca949474",
      "translation": "公主，不，那个名叫蕾洁菲尔妲的女人，不过是一个只顾自身安危、不顾世界的魔女。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a7dc331887a3591a116edc96f3bf27c99767578e3167a778d4a818dac4623b7c",
      "source_sha256": "4e9754b026ee2abd2a368e5c54858e554a6122cb7994336a9809ec1ff934d5af",
      "translation": "只要她还活着，灾祸种就会永远降临这个世界。最终，世界必将灭亡。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8ffeea34de48d438e19f21320cdd1103afedba23871e7e745a42908997c1c7e2",
      "source_sha256": "3881b7ed72d7d4e189e130b612cc8ac649b9e9c3287c473adeb54cce786293db",
      "translation": "不行……兰兹海姆怎么能灭亡。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4f522cc4d5c9eebdff1f4582e20760bb8c6a9db1a76d27e57a495f15840722ca",
      "source_sha256": "e6fffa5efbe7ea11a8b94ebe11fb140d5486caf59a4763787b2df3ce0104e353",
      "translation": "让公主去牺牲啊！我们想活下去！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e4bf6cb33039701b494093be28cadda10a22e41f211a45d783827eca3ab2af63",
      "source_sha256": "8324944972d73d3ddac52d2a39a236018e7a069d8860f49eaa367a016da7246b",
      "translation": "就是。现在已经这么难熬了……灾祸种要是一直下，我们该怎么办！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:650f6a2ffe3c70054b539fae7b07f3fcd91e79655a375bdac4250a9768d19a38",
      "source_sha256": "bb0fb3ad9511ae389751778125e7b281f4b928433272e9ca52f086cd8ca6d5c3",
      "translation": "杀了公主！让她为发动战争负责！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8b6cc756fde407b2c096643508dcf1967825543469e487f3342b508c5252b8ff",
      "source_sha256": "80a2e71db30347807855e27c456f87564b2a64e0ab2959ba0c47b9b377cbb330",
      "translation": "什么啊，太荒唐了。这种话……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:464efa901812bd86688b863400cace3d22c26009d2c7a8a711af417865b8dfea",
      "source_sha256": "35819d58d7f379ceb39853fe8806f6d33d9735540a538472bc86102d9b077abc",
      "translation": "克罗塞尔，冷静点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f24df97c69e61563c9e9b03f17864aa1944bb999c881fe5d1af1607801b2d56a",
      "source_sha256": "e28dc1bf6182d2af251fc384705cb65b8bab49c43840517546b98d5935ecf2b4",
      "translation": "你要我眼睁睁看着这一切！？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:40bfaee319d0aa2e8c137710f63fe1189a8a4a7219df3d3808f155cd8ba91691",
      "source_sha256": "d14706e8bc548962c3645bc3bc4d2821109c12e6a1a2c366915dd2831957d185",
      "translation": "不能在这里闹事。我们是来救洁菲的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7b9acf4b271513a60cd0323ae6ef2a1c425524a40591a41b5d3c51cfc79c2593",
      "source_sha256": "c746f93ad5bdc02f3738bb71b3b63ab8b8c471f85c5aefd7823d1c64ab6ff130",
      "translation": "为了洁菲，忍一忍……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a2b6a78b02b9b070bb53925804d96e34567f615414c019cba639c52b0d8705c",
      "source_sha256": "c282c9961d7013f3cf9e4a4dfca57cca31dc22ef6937a195abcf7292f23aa090",
      "translation": "可恶……竟然全都被这种谎言耍得团团转。明明一直只会依赖公主。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89827aff7e13888aa646837b2e9aa146aba5e01da97253c1ae0bdcdc463c2ca1",
      "source_sha256": "70d87069882429c7f2625e2fa8dd17256e3c97bda5bc8ab99da840a9a3ec576c",
      "translation": "走到今天这一步，我经历了无比漫长而痛苦的岁月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d82e0032f8b9e3039a044b687242ca214ed20f91e11f19d69309dd7ba0be7bd6",
      "source_sha256": "b2c4b87fc583edcf42a4e20724081d348d14a691bfda9b0fe5bc47874ba74385",
      "translation": "我始终等待着向世人揭露真相的这一刻，无论背负多少污名，都一直忍耐着。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f5df9eb66af016ae2b83bc1904ec4d5698efda85a5a62d66d87f8589ebe45f51",
      "source_sha256": "845ed087ccb85c98da3c29e7bdc139ad0fad7831a657799edc1268bea4f541f3",
      "translation": "幸好，亚历克斯伯爵终于理解了我的心意，为拯救兰兹海姆，加入了我们的行列。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8d115d084af4a737a19da9e20eb5c7b55d2bf2f57d5b3e66efb628829c7fedc3",
      "source_sha256": "0965072f36af8ea8c7a1015d66c53104323d66913a560c56bfdbdb56d24b3978",
      "translation": "因此，我们毫无意义的战争，如今结束了。这场灾祸种，也很快就会停止。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e5415cdee0849c900a37c89c23f71520d3c095f90eb25985a540f6e3311fa919",
      "source_sha256": "adae31685641c1ccce420b1bead9d654ff798fe323dd2a936f642f3d25aa236a",
      "translation": "好了，请各位仔细听我说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9ce65123d77e302cb7bd05289e6e736248b628d12beea1022bb2af0b41ea2f03",
      "source_sha256": "9dcb06fd92725870b36215ab686aa7eb0cb5f3d9e5fa507e2a30dd5e97201ac2",
      "translation": "现在，我要向引发内战的真正罪魁祸首——魔女蕾洁菲尔妲，追究未能守护世界的责任！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:afb8478b6b4df6d1ef5c0daadc15e41d30b7a03fff40594745ada41fa3fa1144",
      "source_sha256": "df91e5b83bb6a0d17a873c36948e96f2655a38a20cc6ac2ae42ff99ef82b5e59",
      "translation": "那么，各位打算怎么做？还要袖手旁观，任由世界崩坏到什么时候？现在，我们必须亲手守护世界！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:77ef51d4424b933e25e87b55a744156e4743de71b04b1684c22e72f0eaceccad",
      "source_sha256": "6d9ecbed4f4ee0239048440e6615d5677563d846fc404870bb2a7913c8348d96",
      "translation": "不能再犹豫了。想守护乐园的人，就一起高呼吧！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:384df0f5fdb7b7d80f23512edd13757b1e05d0e4cde44c268af4255d1162f66d",
      "source_sha256": "c07d77a5b599cca47075c9fdc1ed61a384cd9404f4948bb8de09b40b47b14007",
      "translation": "为了这永恒的乐园，让魔女做出牺牲！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a043603043af097e15d714011c3b495e648cec9665fda8fcb5038a53e7de1819",
      "source_sha256": "b452f19f3818b7c2477dbb365efe8e9610d1c6baf3a2f9d6905db4efd9b300f6",
      "translation": "杀死魔女！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d40e7d30987a76325289cd866f701adbf713ebe9aaa70da9e2042bb1a5838258",
      "source_sha256": "511ab0df5f5fef33a8ca90ec4e058e74b3236041db7a990d4725b4380d257f87",
      "translation": "杀了公主！处死她！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3c73e57e5a18205f85b840a2f028db510018ad8877dec9f7c3caac8d0e507903",
      "source_sha256": "a37340a24f610a9551bbfbb7d717c8285316543fae441d599ba47bca421c7bfc",
      "translation": "公、公主……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:526ddc4f6c0cd31d4e036fd633b5681aa59f1fae0ba2ac4b4987d41f42810ea7",
      "source_sha256": "f8af6aa922822057c204c6a212279a8f14e92c9345e30dcbcec065edb3961322",
      "translation": "（不能丢下洁菲离开。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65a90bf62a1db6a73e9470b2776fd33d88b4cb9dcf0e8e23244e32cd2ba2ad26",
      "source_sha256": "78ee9bb59a05b39cbe85172dda8d565517acea5845259eeb52434d99b222b0f6",
      "translation": "（不能就这样回去。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2de339b828dd259d9ecd3e5df81cfffe027cd345e9ffb3352faa183b843e3e6e",
      "source_sha256": "69d597501db6115b861cfa82d0a4f58e5340d1eabe077073980106b13c535e8e",
      "translation": "（必须救出洁菲姐姐。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0bed70bea503388111f1d12f9eee795fd18cbd1b22d5c47ec8c5dc0841a95d4f",
      "source_sha256": "4fc472ca6c04d60f30d3d225dcfbe072a022691556ca247d563cbd9e21dd8a97",
      "translation": "（必须救出公主。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:57a4e368abfd5ee8650bc3d51e878920bc1c10d6b95717ace4db5e616993a2b0",
      "source_sha256": "a0f3fa7226d10980b937747c6713650690a522587c6366b3f39bc992a316f152",
      "translation": "（不能放过那些北部军的家伙。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cc3e04ec6b92840c3b370aa5bb8bdc841d24c1a456bbaa61717f6cdf359c0e11",
      "source_sha256": "8adaa2a301e03210ab3f92594cdb71ce84daa6dfcd588c4b31d75449ba93a96c",
      "translation": "这里交给我，你们快逃！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7a04fa177b545ee24e2c698dbf8ffabdf7e46d0e4d496f4bd6e4d79ed23a3bcc",
      "source_sha256": "1ca30bf52f2b5a5fd200f35d2f59f205714a57700d6f63a17d721dd3e3651119",
      "translation": "来吧，放马过来！我的爱不会输给你们！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e1e2f8c769e74217c7a10a497451c6986f89164c578c840d5ead6e85dc96db81",
      "source_sha256": "14c95e3282dce9d1e42c6262595bccb11970e57662672625d1a923a68951bcd3",
      "translation": "听说南部军总司令要来贝尔福特。终于要发动总攻了吗？哈，这下就只剩灭亡了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d0864b4057b71847b6acd2955fd6bda03c133715427a85ca40745f848ec316f2",
      "source_sha256": "67daab62a126e0cd7e9c53ce7fd17c9b12e23acb64ad11413f26bcf48af720d8",
      "translation": "看来，最后的战争终于要开始了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6720d614ce2f480840dc05a1fca245084c7efeb0a2420e8b7a1997fe8db9a79f",
      "source_sha256": "3ad301dd37f0283feedf009cc5546125d2f9878b5968f1c8071fdedd8dd253e2",
      "translation": "真希望这场战争快点结束。怀着这份希望活到现在，都不知道已经多少年了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e0248d20d8ad3c6af51cf4f11edbf190f391f794e491507cbb095b5804cfaed7",
      "source_sha256": "bb6fa53661f7178601ee2f5082e0e85e7fe39065510c5820c901f4b2ee0b371c",
      "translation": "明明有这么多人厌恶战争……你们到底为什么还要战斗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2f4b66cf955cc7a41a7c47c3f136c5f7568ff878a4ab20059d5eddad4588932d",
      "source_sha256": "a850590be8d396b587dd083182d6ffe588bfbe2593b75a82cc693134fdef7543",
      "translation": "就是因为战争一直持续，灾祸种才不会停止。再这样下去，世界就会灭亡！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:390555e3bd17c05dd03d0607cfaee4477431b8e727f1594d39121b3b51c09665",
      "source_sha256": "2b4521a53fc5be88a6e56251a582c4cc93a42bc2c07e0747e72655def30e00a5",
      "translation": "这下亚历克斯来了，就会结束战争了吧！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7f5c88b620802f8105fba8e1d60ed522d52d907ef152e253ed266ae8ef147b8a",
      "source_sha256": "9370d1d1f117dfd600dd46cb573321030b8907fd240d02f45b709ad3899db099",
      "translation": "要不是这场战争，那家伙不过是个普通贵族。虽然不甘心让他当国王，可也没办法。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89a2ebdc59e2ed48ed31cd936258110fdcb40f7bf45a77b693e736cc8f2e2a55",
      "source_sha256": "c0418769d079c815bf9d58d95fcaa1cf2c7a2d924b25f67b1707925057365701",
      "translation": "一会儿说亚历克斯大人来了要发动总攻，一会儿又说要缔结停战协议……谣言满天飞，到底哪个才是真的？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ad8f583e0c2abf5a2a9034d9580fd80cce1d226e719127dc8d32080345e123d2",
      "source_sha256": "2fb7094eae2e15b986aff430ce41c25773042c4d54e58469cafc43036ca99af2",
      "translation": "听说亚历克斯大人要来，得准备的东西可多了。我们这些底层干的活，总是这么回事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:076e73f2adf7e986d4e419b452f8ff872cdabe64d10084487e34412beadad25b",
      "source_sha256": "b051f88f7584d7279083468e56982160de0384142b53f794db6c8623b54d5707",
      "translation": "听说要举行一场盛大的演说……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fc4f43a01f15aa9f62c0d746eea8cb1cad2083383b39afcf298623262595882c",
      "source_sha256": "5a511da23aa5c2d0054af36bffe7556dc3b11d6e8aa7e627c03bc6f9a67af0b8",
      "translation": "有空就来帮帮忙啊。大人物要来时，总是这样。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f93dcb55be0bb3216efa6dd709d89cc8148cac0773ce23e8bbe4bc6bceab74fe",
      "source_sha256": "7a7352d937375ad27a2cc069b51c112cfd1346c0ca470646e922660b7dd728b8",
      "translation": "听说，这种对峙局面很快就要结束了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:49863415b761f2795744c23ced4a15a97e128a22bf5a5cbc0ccff6fe2cd54ece",
      "source_sha256": "ca7c4ca740e7cc40e4bd0743569cb03a2f9ceff537306392c128f99529890edb",
      "translation": "对我来说虽然是好消息，可究竟会怎样结束呢……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7a24a9a52908b409dc7d18f51d2af7fba831c12f67b807c694d9805c72da2df0",
      "source_sha256": "aa02ad5ad09eb01e2a438aae88d27129ac5ff25be4a2fd8ec515ebe6b7a6336b",
      "translation": "反哨兵部队也做好准备吧，这可能是最后一场战斗了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:73df704ce3ef4d3a2a67710a05ff68301fc0a14cb58f0b96f3f267ad84b20299",
      "source_sha256": "24296713dde8ca6e5059ce39891b592293ec67f595998981166b3998a835e016",
      "translation": "竟敢欺骗我们，你这魔女！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:87fe9d8a80d1e2f2e4e7c5328ead8fe0172f50783d16aae456d62c8d41ce5270",
      "source_sha256": "bc814d940f5287bfbc49b027ca509547059553c5b2d618c580d4319d496be632",
      "translation": "杀了公主！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3db83bd8cae07b9c9b8485c2af37827b22dad0e729fd6126922969e45b346a61",
      "source_sha256": "33d6a690584165ea25846917f41a2f633aeed5f90abc30cffbc1f5ef64dd25fb",
      "translation": "你想让世界灭亡吗！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f8179dd08b0abbcf8f06e159cb548773524f3cc72a5f0cf60136dc735a0c034",
      "source_sha256": "c2c70d3affc6e0ebeb08ced144974b3262c1d1a6e08b8cc665fb042bc192111f",
      "translation": "在你们毁灭世界之前，我就先在这里消灭你们！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}
